+### Cure Procedure
+
+1. At any research station, discard 5 City cards of the disease color (4 for the Scientist). The station city’s color does not need to match.
+2. Move that disease’s cure marker to its Cure Indicator. This marker movement records the discovered cure.
+3. **A cured disease keeps its existing cubes and can still infect during both infections and Epidemics; eradication stops that disease’s new placements.** If no cubes of that color are on the board when the cure is discovered, immediately eradicate it and flip the marker.
 
